[38;5;252m[1m## Notable translation decisions[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1mDavid Gay's dtoa was ported rather than replaced.[22m Rust's own float formatting is correctly rounded but not guaranteed to break ties the same way, so [38;5;10mdtoa_r[0m's [38;5;10mUSE_BF96[0m path is translated line-for-line — the 96-bit tables, the three progressively slower fast paths, the Bigint fallback, and its [38;5;10mgoto[0m graph as a state machine. Out-of-range shifts use [38;5;10mwrapping_shl[0m/[38;5;10mwrapping_shr[0m to match x86 semantics the C relies on.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1mVariadic entry points use naked-function trampolines.[22m Stable Rust can't define C variadic functions, so [38;5;10mjson_pack[0m, [38;5;10mjson_pack_ex[0m, [38;5;10mjson_unpack[0m, [38;5;10mjson_unpack_ex[0m, [38;5;10mjson_sprintf[0m and [38;5;10mjsonp_error_set[0m are [38;5;10m#[naked][0m stubs that build a System V AMD64 [38;5;10mva_list[0m exactly as GCC's prologue does, then tail into the [38;5;10mv*[0m function. [38;5;10mva_arg[0m is implemented against the psABI register-save-area layout.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1mMemory goes through libc.[22m [38;5;10mjsonp_malloc[0m/[38;5;10mjsonp_free[0m wrap [38;5;10mmalloc[0m/[38;5;10mfree[0m so [38;5;10mjson_dumps[0m results remain [38;5;10mfree()[0m-able by callers, and [38;5;10mjson_get_alloc_funcs[0m returns the real libc pointers. Allocation sites and sizes mirror the C exactly.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1mBugs and quirks preserved[22m, including the [38;5;10mnrv_alloc[0m [38;5;10mrv = 0; t = rv + n[0m pointer arithmetic on NULL, [38;5;10mstrchr[0m matching the NUL terminator of [38;5;10munpack_value_starters[0m, signed-char sign extension in the lexer's [38;5;10mstream_get[0m, and the exact [38;5;10merror->text[0m truncation/[38;5;10mcode[0m-in-last-byte layout.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
One measurement caveat worth naming: my allocator test's total-bytes figure varies run to run in [1mboth[22m libraries, because [38;5;10mjsonp_loop_check[0m formats heap pointers with [38;5;10m%p[0m and the resulting key length feeds an allocation size — ASLR noise, not an implementation difference. Allocation counts and live bytes are stable and match.[0m[0m
